usage: tego session list [--json]
   or: tego session show <session> | --last [--json]
   or: tego session stop <session> | --agent <name> [--grace <d>]
   or: tego session pause <session>
   or: tego session resume <session>

   list             List sessions
   show             Show what a session did and what Tego refused
   stop             Stop a running session
   pause            Pause a running session
   resume           Resume a paused session

See 'tego help session <command>' to read about a specific command.
